+---
+id: def-qftx-bps-state-and-saturation
+kind: definition
+title: BPS state and central-charge saturation
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
